      "name": "Cult Icon",
      "pointsCost": 30,
      "costNote": null,
      "category": null,
      "effects": [
        "Friendly Genestealer Cults Infantry units that can draw line of sight to the bearer, and who have at least 1 model within 12\" of the bearer, increase their Leadership characteristic by 1.",
        "While the bearer is on the battlefield and positioned wholly within range of a Primary Objective Marker in No Man's Land, it is considered to have an Objective Control value of 20.",
        "While the bearer is on the battlefield and positioned wholly within range of a Primary Objective Marker in No Man's Land, friendly Genestealer Cults Infantry units currently in Strategic Reserves reduce the required minimum distance they must maintain from enemy units as detailed under the Cult Ambush rule when they use the Enter the Battlefield from Strategic Reserves Action within 12\" of the bearer."
      ],
      "effectsHtml": "<ul>\n<li>Friendly <span class=\"keyword\" data-term=\"genestealer-cults-infantry\" data-type=\"keyword\">Genestealer Cults Infantry</span> units that can draw line of sight to the bearer, and who have at least 1 model within 12\" of the bearer, increase their Leadership characteristic by 1.</li>\n<li>While the bearer is on the battlefield and positioned wholly within range of a Primary Objective Marker in No Man's Land, it is considered to have an Objective Control value of 20.</li>\n<li>While the bearer is on the battlefield and positioned wholly within range of a Primary Objective Marker in No Man's Land, friendly <span class=\"keyword\" data-term=\"genestealer-cults-infantry\" data-type=\"keyword\">Genestealer Cults Infantry</span> units currently in Strategic Reserves reduce the required minimum distance they must maintain from enemy units as detailed under the Cult Ambush rule when they use the <span class=\"keyword\" data-term=\"enter-the-battlefield-from-strategic-reserves\" data-type=\"action\">Enter the Battlefield from Strategic Reserves</span> Action within 12\" of the bearer.</li>\n</ul>",
